<br />
                    Situated on the pilgrims' route to Mt. St Micheal between the villages of St Martin de Connée and La Chaussée d'Orthe, there stands an ancient cross at the junction of three chemins. It is well weat...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
